<title>UK: London palladium fixed at $179.75, high since 1989.</title>
<headline>London palladium fixed at $179.75, high since 1989.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palladium fixed at $179.75 per ounce, its highest fixing since April 14, 1989 on Tuesday afternoon.</p>
<p>This morning the metal was fixed at $177.50.</p>
</text>
